// Episode level 2. Coordinates in metres, x = east, y = north, z = up.
// Route: the neon street (start west end, facing east; parked cars, a poster kiosk, planters,
// a dumpster; the shotgun and shells in the south doorway) → the two bouncers under the club
// canopy, the chaingun in the neon alcove south of the door → the club: through the vestibule,
// across the raised dance floor (fires channel 1: the two staff closets in the east wall open,
// awake) past the DJ booth and speaker stacks; glass VIP booths on the north wall, the bar on the
// south wall → the back door in the east wall → the staff lounge (pool table, vending, couch) →
// north up the staff hall → the manager's door → the Blue key → back into the staff hall, west
// along the corridor to the blue door → the office lobby (pillars, sofas, planters): up the riser
// behind the reception desk for the jetpack (fires channel 2: the two elevator doors in the west
// wall open, awake) → the lift in the north wall up to the cubicle floors: tier 1 (z 3) → the
// stairs east to tier 2 (z 6) → the lift up to tier 3 (z 9) → the stairs and door east into the
// elevator shaft, on the catwalk at z 12 → the upper lift (z 12 → 24) to the top ledge and the
// Yellow key → the yellow door → the penthouse terrace (the welcome mat fires channel 3: two
// cabanas in the west wall open, awake) → around the pool to the suite → the exit switch on the
// suite's east wall. The lower shaft lift (z 0 → 12) brings a player who falls back up.
// Secrets: (1) a crouch vent over the bar (footrail z 0.5, bar top 1.05, vent 1.1-2.3) into the
// stockroom (rocket launcher, armour); (2) the server-room crack wall on tier 3 (a barrel beside
// it): stash with an atom and rockets; (3) a jetpack-only ledge at z 18 on the shaft's east wall
// (atom; validate warns "unreachable item" for it, by design). The toilets' crack wall (barrel
// beside it) opens an ammo stash that is not a counted secret ("unreachable item" warnings for
// its items, and for secret 2's, are crack-wall stashes, by design).
// Built by `rr-tools build` from levels/src/neon_nights.ron. Do not edit; edit the source and rebuild.
